::  An island whose update crashes, so the browser shows the crash notice.
++ main (program init update view subs)

+$ model @ud
+$ msg %press

++ init |= ~ 0

++ update |= [=msg m=model] !!

++ subs |= m=model ~

++ view |= m=model
  column ~[gap+%s1] ~[
    (text "Pressed {m} times")
    button "Press" %press
